                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Speed Dating for Ghosts is pretty good. It's less of a dating game and more like speed-dating roulette where you get to know whoever sits in front of you- except the entire dating pool is dead.\n\nThe ghosts have interesting stories, and your choices actually impact how each \"date\" goes, which made meeting them and replaying conversations worth it.\n\nIf you like interesting characters, impactful choices, dry humor, puns, and something that can be emotional without losing its lightheartedness, you'll probably enjoy this. It's also incredibly cheap for the experience you get.",
